+// and a kind a record is written, as unfold_action does; no prompt). Tag: the team id (the Lua value is a team id
+// already). Outside a scope (a global effect, setup) p is a real seat: FFA the seat, Tag its team. -1 for a value
+// that names no seat (PLAYER_NONE, PLAYER_ALL, 2 or more in a scope, no living opponent). At n == 2: p.
